<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9262] Web console: missed generation of query entities for imported domain modelss</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9262</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open configuration overview.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Import cluster from dabase.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open cluster configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Download generated project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Downloaded project does not contains generated QueryEntities, that are visible in project preview.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;They appear on configuration page refresh.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Second problem:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Import domain models with new cluster creation.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Quickly open cluster&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Quickly Save and download cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Error in log is received: angular.js:13018 GET &lt;a href=&quot;http://localhost:9000/api/v1/configuration/5b72b9ca7396bb79794a1a9b&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://localhost:9000/api/v1/configuration/5b72b9ca7396bb79794a1a9b&lt;/a&gt; 500 (Internal Server Error)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
